msgid "WordPress Emojis"
msgstr ""

#: admin/settings-page-output.php:55
msgid "This option will remove all the styles and scripts related to native Wordpress emoji module;%3$s be aware - it will also remove emojis from TinyMCE editor."
msgstr ""

#: admin/settings-page-output.php:56
msgid "About ~20kb of savings + removal of CDN calls and stylesheets."
msgstr ""

#: admin/settings-page-output.php:59
msgid "Disable WordPress emojis?"
